1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,539
Twenty minutes

2
00:00:00,539 --> 00:00:01,456
cross-legged.

3
00:00:01,456 --> 00:00:02,667
You stand up,

4
00:00:02,667 --> 00:00:03,186
and—

5
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,130
Your leg...

6
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,733
is still meditating.

7
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,432
Then comes the fizz.

8
00:00:08,432 --> 00:00:10,200
Pins and NEEDLES!

9
00:00:10,228 --> 00:00:10,970
You didn't cut off

10
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,310
your circulation.

11
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,290
You squashed

12
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:14,335
a NERVE...

13
00:00:14,335 --> 00:00:15,431
and the tiny vessels

14
00:00:15,431 --> 00:00:16,367
that feed it.

15
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,238
Starved,

16
00:00:17,238 --> 00:00:18,333
it goes quiet.

17
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,395
Your brain can't feel

18
00:00:19,395 --> 00:00:20,090
the foot...

19
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:21,000
or find it.

20
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,030
Then you move.

21
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:23,025
Blood rushes back,

22
00:00:23,025 --> 00:00:24,850
and the nerve reboots...

23
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:25,567
badly.

24
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:26,704
Scientists have recorded

25
00:00:26,704 --> 00:00:28,137
its fibres firing

26
00:00:28,137 --> 00:00:29,290
by themselves,

27
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,367
hundreds of times a second.

28
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,414
Nothing is touching

29
00:00:32,414 --> 00:00:33,600
your skin.

30
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:34,970
It's static...

31
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:36,770
and your brain guesses:

32
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:37,933
needles?

33
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:39,110
It's harmless.

34
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,367
Wiggle your toes...

35
00:00:40,589 --> 00:00:41,830
and try to look

36
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,250
enlightened.

37
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,130
Next up:

38
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,409
why your recorded voice

39
00:00:45,409 --> 00:00:46,894
sounds weird.

40
00:00:46,894 --> 00:00:47,900
Subscribe...

41
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,118
quietly.

